        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: அவசரநிலை",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவசரநிலை — avacaranilai — \"an emergency\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மழை நின்றால், அவசரநிலை முடிவுக்கு வரும். maḻai niṉṟāl, avacaranilai muṭivukku varum. If the rain stops, the emergency will come to an end."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "From அவசரம், urgency, and நிலை, a state."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அவசரநிலை (avacaranilai) joins அவசரம், \"urgency\", borrowed from Sanskrit avasara, \"occasion\" (CDIAL 858), with native நிலை, \"state, condition\" (DEDR 3675)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
